00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.390
But like, it's gotten to
the point where I'm like,

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:36.800
Oh. If me and this person
were to date or something.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.030
I think friend crushes
happen a lot at Jubilee.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.970
I had friend crush on Zach when he joined.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:42.060
